Worked example of F6-32: the two-streams scenario of F6-28 (Figure 1), written by hand
in the export format. Lines without the csv prefix are ignored, like this one.
csv: lane,start,end,stream,label
csv: copy-in,0.0,30.0,1,A-in
csv: copy-in,30.0,60.0,2,B-in
csv: compute,30.0,70.0,1,A-kernel
csv: compute,70.0,110.0,2,B-kernel
csv: copy-out,70.0,100.0,1,A-out
csv: copy-out,110.0,140.0,2,B-out
